h that in mind he was convinced  he'd be worshipped as the world's  smartest man get again Laurie Blake and  Looking Glass had other ideas though and  armed with the video Veidt made for  newly elected president Robert Redford  in 1985 they decided to arrest him for  the deaths of the three million in New  York and for the conspiracy that had  continued  since via intermittent squid rain  engineered by bite after a strange trial  on Europa Veidt is presumably headed for  another trial on earth but this time  he's likely to have plenty of defenders  who hail him as a visionary who did what  he had to in order to save the world for  all we know Veidt won't even survive  long enough for a trial but that might  be with lorry and LG are angling for  as for Redford who became a  co-conspirator invites plan when he took  office Blake makes it clear that it  would be fine with her to bring the  president up on charges as well which  means the United States government is  about to be rocked by a lot of upheaval  much of Watchmen season finale is  devoted to explaining exactly what was  really going on with the mysterious lady  true and it turns out there's quite a  history to mine lady truth the smartest  woman in the world was born to a mother  who stole a semen sample from adrian  veidt's private vaults true inherited  veidt's intellect ambition and  insatiable ego and it all led her to  believe that she was the only one in the  world worthy of holding dr. Manhattan's  power if I can take his power I can fix  the world as it turns out true was  planning to kill Manhattan all along and  her millenium clock house to the device  that would have allowed her to do it  Adrian Veidt was able to stop her at the  last moment with a reign of frozen squid  but while lady true is dead her legacy  is not beyond the Cologne of trues own  mother who served as her daughter is  still alive and her massive corporation  and its many Holdings will go to her  will beyond learn the right lesson